# Layers built from primitives with the same algebra: a SwiGLU MLP and an output-gated
# attention, spelled out with `*` gating and explicit projections. Widths are checked:
# a residual branch has to come back to d_model. The gate follows the output projection
# (G5 in Qiu et al., 2025); their best, G1, gates each head before it: gqa(gated=true).
d_model    = 512
vocab_size = 32000
hidden     = 1408

swiglu     = (linear(features=hidden) swish * linear(features=hidden)) linear(features=d_model)
gated_attn = gqa(num_heads=8, num_kv_heads=8, rope=rope()) * linear(features=d_model) sigmoid

block = [rmsnorm gated_attn] [rmsnorm swiglu]
model = embed block^8 rmsnorm head(tied=true)
